WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.300
[Episode 32]

01:34.520 --> 01:36.279
I heard that Ku He never imparted

01:36.440 --> 01:38.160
that technique to any outsiders.

01:38.840 --> 01:40.559
I have to give it a try somehow.

01:50.800 --> 01:52.579
Don't hide the dagger
inside your sleeve.

01:52.599 --> 01:53.960
You might get hurt.

02:00.560 --> 02:01.720
Actually,

02:02.000 --> 02:05.520
you don't have to tell me
about the letter with Miss Duoduo.

02:06.920 --> 02:08.419
But you ask me,

02:08.439 --> 02:09.759
and I have to tell you.

02:10.760 --> 02:11.880
Do you?

02:12.519 --> 02:13.959
I promised you

02:14.519 --> 02:15.959
I wouldn't lie to you.

02:36.160 --> 02:37.240
Wan'er,

02:38.360 --> 02:40.440
is anything bothering you?

02:45.279 --> 02:46.919
Before my brother was killed,

02:48.399 --> 02:50.120
had you already found out

02:50.320 --> 02:52.600
that the Niulan Street assassination
was his plan?

03:05.560 --> 03:06.939
Who was in the Zuixian Pleasure House

03:06.959 --> 03:08.959
with Si Lili that day?

03:09.600 --> 03:11.919
It was the Second Young Master
of Lin's Residence,

03:12.640 --> 03:13.880
Ling Gong.

03:17.040 --> 03:18.120
Yes.

03:19.719 --> 03:21.079
Did you

03:21.760 --> 03:23.199
kill him?

03:24.239 --> 03:25.359
Not me.

03:28.600 --> 03:30.479
You know who killed him?

03:32.999 --> 03:33.920
I killed Lin Gong.

03:33.920 --> 03:35.819
Who gave you the right to kill him?

03:35.839 --> 03:37.440
Young Lady gave me the right.

03:39.439 --> 03:40.519
I do.

03:42.480 --> 03:44.440
Is it someone around you?

03:52.640 --> 03:53.720
Yes.

04:13.880 --> 04:15.560
My brother intended to kill you,

04:16.360 --> 04:18.159
so you retaliated.

04:19.559 --> 04:20.920
Your action

04:21.360 --> 04:22.599
is reasonable.

04:27.119 --> 04:28.959
But reason

04:29.639 --> 04:31.639
isn't the only way
that works in this world.

04:32.199 --> 04:33.800
He was my brother.

04:36.320 --> 04:38.040
I have been sick since I was little,

04:38.559 --> 04:40.000
and I couldn't go out.

04:41.280 --> 04:43.759
He came to the palace for me

04:44.400 --> 04:46.719
and cheered me up
with anything he could.

04:47.559 --> 04:49.079
Do you understand?

04:54.639 --> 04:56.959
I shouldn't hate you,

04:57.720 --> 04:59.480
but I can't help it.

05:01.319 --> 05:02.519
I understand.

05:04.319 --> 05:06.199
Humans have feelings.

05:14.040 --> 05:15.639
Why didn't you lie to me?

05:15.910 --> 05:17.580
Why didn't you keep this to yourself
forever?

05:17.600 --> 05:18.700
Even if you denied it

05:18.720 --> 05:20.780
and lied to me,
I would believe you no matter what.

05:20.800 --> 05:22.010
I only believe in what you say.

05:22.030 --> 05:23.679
Even if all evidence
were laid bare before me,

05:23.679 --> 05:24.900
I wouldn't believe it.

05:24.920 --> 05:26.480
I would pretend not to see it.

05:26.840 --> 05:29.480
Why didn't you lie to me my whole life?

05:31.600 --> 05:32.680
I'm sorry.

06:00.639 --> 06:02.040
Your Majesty.

06:03.480 --> 06:04.700
Please slow down.

06:04.720 --> 06:06.460
This isn't appropriate.

06:06.480 --> 06:07.820
Please allow me...

06:07.840 --> 06:08.460
Oh, my.

06:08.480 --> 06:09.820
Your Majesty,

06:09.840 --> 06:12.920
please allow me
to announce your arrival first.

06:16.160 --> 06:17.539
Please hear me out.

06:17.559 --> 06:19.020
I should go in

06:19.040 --> 06:20.940
and announce your arrival first.

06:20.960 --> 06:22.560
Do you agree?

06:22.600 --> 06:23.680
Your Majesty.

06:32.040 --> 06:34.759
Greetings, Your Majesty.

06:45.639 --> 06:47.120
This is rare.

06:49.480 --> 06:51.260
I haven't seen you

06:51.280 --> 06:52.920
since the murder case that year.

06:54.480 --> 06:58.920
I seem to remember
that you are afraid of the dark, right?

06:59.879 --> 07:00.959
Your Majesty,

07:02.079 --> 07:03.719
I'm afraid of the dark

07:04.360 --> 07:06.680
because the wailing of my family

07:06.999 --> 07:08.839
still haunts me.

07:09.879 --> 07:11.040
I can't let it go.

07:11.920 --> 07:13.440
However,

07:13.520 --> 07:15.000
I think

07:16.119 --> 07:17.639
it's time.

07:22.920 --> 07:24.000
Your Majesty.

07:25.999 --> 07:28.240
I'm here to confess.

07:29.840 --> 07:31.560
What have you done?

07:31.879 --> 07:33.199
I'm rebellious.

07:38.999 --> 07:40.480
Back then,

07:40.800 --> 07:43.040
you executed my whole clan,

07:44.239 --> 07:45.719
however,

07:46.280 --> 07:49.040
you kept me as the empress
for so many years.

07:50.160 --> 07:52.440
You are kind to me.

07:52.632 --> 07:54.519
But I had been dwelling

07:54.559 --> 07:57.360
in hatred for years

07:57.679 --> 07:59.880
and even avoiding you.

08:00.759 --> 08:02.639
I was being ungrateful.

08:03.199 --> 08:06.199
My sin is too unspeakable.

08:10.559 --> 08:13.240
Are you here to seek death?

08:14.040 --> 08:16.199
I'm truly unforgivable.

08:18.759 --> 08:21.440
You could've hung yourself.

08:26.679 --> 08:27.839
Your Majesty,

08:28.520 --> 08:29.800
I mustn't do that.

08:30.639 --> 08:32.040
As of now,

08:32.319 --> 08:33.640
I'm still the empress.

08:33.679 --> 08:35.320
If I were to kill myself,

08:35.560 --> 08:37.359
it might leave an unsavory record

08:37.559 --> 08:39.440
in history.

08:41.240 --> 08:43.440
If it were to tarnish your reputation,

08:44.040 --> 08:45.719
I couldn't be forgiven,

08:45.800 --> 08:47.400
even with my death.

08:48.240 --> 08:51.380
Please strip of my title as empress

08:51.400 --> 08:52.879
before you punish me.

08:57.719 --> 08:59.280
I can't get over this.

09:01.719 --> 09:02.879
I know.

09:03.719 --> 09:05.640
No matter what decision you make,

09:06.079 --> 09:07.520
I understand you.

09:22.079 --> 09:24.160
But I can't kill you.

09:25.479 --> 09:26.800
I owe you this.

09:31.880 --> 09:33.280
Who's the murderer?

09:33.599 --> 09:35.160
I need a name.

09:36.760 --> 09:38.599
Is it Mr. Wuzhu?

09:39.520 --> 09:40.800
You said

09:41.160 --> 09:43.119
he had been with you
since you were little.

09:44.280 --> 09:45.360
Yes.

09:45.880 --> 09:47.280
So did my brother.

09:48.319 --> 09:50.359
What would you do

09:51.150 --> 09:52.680
if someone killed Mr. Wuzhu?

09:55.319 --> 09:56.680
I would go crazy.

09:56.800 --> 09:57.559
I would seek revenge.

09:57.559 --> 09:58.999
Me too.

10:02.920 --> 10:04.479
One last question.

10:05.559 --> 10:06.959
Did you

10:09.280 --> 10:11.320
give him the order?

10:14.839 --> 10:15.819
Sort of.

10:15.839 --> 10:17.040
Sort of?

10:19.040 --> 10:21.280
Mr. Wuzhu wasn't with me.

10:21.559 --> 10:22.959
I wanted to do it myself.

10:22.959 --> 10:24.240
I had already left the Capital.

10:24.240 --> 10:25.920
I was one step behind.

10:27.000 --> 10:28.359
He wasn't with you.

10:29.199 --> 10:30.620
So he acted on his own accord.

10:30.640 --> 10:31.559
Not him, it was me.

10:31.559 --> 10:32.719
I had that intention.

10:32.719 --> 10:33.839
It's different.

10:39.199 --> 10:40.599
I will kill him.

10:41.359 --> 10:42.959
I will kill Wuzhu.

10:44.959 --> 10:46.620
Mr. Wuzhu fought with Ku He before.

10:46.640 --> 10:48.539
His strength is on par
with a grandmaster's.

10:48.559 --> 10:49.299
I know.

10:49.319 --> 10:50.699
You can't hurt him.

10:50.719 --> 10:51.999
I know that too.

10:52.400 --> 10:53.879
Just because I can't

10:54.880 --> 10:56.520
doesn't mean I shouldn't.

10:56.920 --> 10:58.640
Wan'er, I won't let Mr. Wuzhu hurt you.

10:58.640 --> 10:59.760
Likewise,

11:00.120 --> 11:02.079
I don't wish you to hurt him.

11:07.479 --> 11:08.959
I'm very disappointed.

11:13.240 --> 11:14.320
I know.

11:15.079 --> 11:16.680
I mean, with myself.

11:26.400 --> 11:28.040
I can't believe

11:28.880 --> 11:29.999
when you said

11:30.559 --> 11:34.199
it wasn't your order,

11:35.040 --> 11:36.999
I actually felt relieved.

11:39.040 --> 11:40.680
That way,

11:41.400 --> 11:42.959
I could take out all my hatred

11:42.959 --> 11:45.280
on Wuzhu alone.

11:46.400 --> 11:48.199
I actually couldn't hate you.

11:49.359 --> 11:51.719
So I'm very disappointed with myself.

11:53.640 --> 11:55.160
In that moment,

11:56.959 --> 11:58.599
I chose you

11:59.439 --> 12:01.199
and betrayed my brother.

12:02.679 --> 12:03.760
Wan'er...

12:05.920 --> 12:07.400
I will kill Wuzhu.

12:08.120 --> 12:09.760
This is between him and me.

12:10.040 --> 12:11.560
It has nothing to do with you.

12:17.559 --> 12:18.760
That's all.

12:19.479 --> 12:21.359
The one who told me this

12:21.640 --> 12:23.079
was Cousin Chengze.

12:23.520 --> 12:25.280
He planned to use me.

12:25.920 --> 12:27.459
Since he had made this move,

12:27.479 --> 12:28.879
he must have a plan.

12:29.120 --> 12:30.520
I should get going.

12:31.400 --> 12:33.239
If he comes again,

12:33.920 --> 12:35.800
I will fish information out of him
for you.

12:58.880 --> 13:00.040
Continue.

13:06.959 --> 13:08.659
As for my accusation,

13:08.679 --> 13:11.339
Fan Xian was attacked
at Guangxin Palace.

13:11.359 --> 13:13.540
I'm the head of the harem.

13:13.560 --> 13:15.760
I should be held accountable
for my negligence.

13:16.439 --> 13:17.959
This accusation

13:18.719 --> 13:20.160
is justified.

13:25.319 --> 13:27.599
You are quite thoughtful.

13:28.599 --> 13:30.440
I should've repaid you

13:30.959 --> 13:32.520
what I owed.

13:32.760 --> 13:33.920
What else?

13:38.520 --> 13:40.199
Before I die,

13:41.760 --> 13:43.479
I would like to visit Fan Xian.

13:48.280 --> 13:49.839
Though the grudges

13:50.439 --> 13:52.320
are long gone,

13:53.959 --> 13:55.400
this poor boy

13:55.959 --> 13:57.959
lost his mother at birth.

13:59.040 --> 14:00.239
So...

14:03.040 --> 14:04.239
So

14:05.280 --> 14:07.119
I should apologize to him.

14:12.959 --> 14:15.320
You apologize to him?

14:17.599 --> 14:19.479
I'm dying anyway.

14:19.920 --> 14:21.879
I can rest in peace

14:22.479 --> 14:24.320
if all the grievances are resolved.

14:27.120 --> 14:29.040
Do you have anything to say?

14:29.280 --> 14:31.079
Li Yunrui is culpable

14:31.359 --> 14:33.359
for the assassination
at Guangxin Palace.

14:33.479 --> 14:35.160
Since I stand down as the empress,

14:35.479 --> 14:37.959
the Elder Princess should be punished.

14:44.079 --> 14:45.579
To be honest,

14:45.599 --> 14:47.999
this request is both for justice

14:48.280 --> 14:49.640
and personal reasons.

14:51.400 --> 14:53.879
I gave up my position

14:54.520 --> 14:56.280
to ease Fan Xian's resentment

14:56.990 --> 14:58.839
so that you wouldn't be torn between us.

14:58.920 --> 15:00.640
Removing Li Yunrui

15:01.199 --> 15:03.719
is to cut off Li Chengze's support.

15:07.040 --> 15:08.239
I did all of this

15:09.000 --> 15:10.640
for the sake of the Crown Prince.

15:12.199 --> 15:14.160
He is kind and pure

15:14.680 --> 15:16.330
and values filial piety greatly.

15:16.719 --> 15:19.280
He holds nothing

15:19.319 --> 15:21.160
but respect for you.

15:22.280 --> 15:23.360
Of course,

15:24.160 --> 15:25.999
he isn't aware

15:26.559 --> 15:28.239
of the request I made just now.

15:28.959 --> 15:30.560
It's my decision alone.

15:44.199 --> 15:45.279
Xian,

15:45.839 --> 15:47.440
I heard everything.

15:48.520 --> 15:50.760
Wan'er can't hurt Mr. Wuzhu.

15:51.760 --> 15:52.920
I know.

15:54.719 --> 15:56.199
So does she.

15:56.760 --> 15:58.440
Instead

15:59.040 --> 16:00.839
of seeking revenge,

16:02.679 --> 16:04.879
she is punishing herself.

16:07.000 --> 16:07.520
What is this?

16:07.540 --> 16:09.780
There was an assassination earlier.
I have to protect you.

16:09.800 --> 16:12.299
I was so nervous
when I saw Wan'er peel the fruit.

16:12.319 --> 16:13.999
She is my wife.

16:14.200 --> 16:16.440
I prepared this dagger
in case anything happens.

16:16.839 --> 16:18.400
Actually, I wanted to use this.

16:18.559 --> 16:19.780
What is that for?

16:19.800 --> 16:21.539
When I was treating you last time,

16:21.559 --> 16:23.800
I asked Leng for some chloroform.

16:24.800 --> 16:26.330
You applied some on the needle?

16:26.599 --> 16:27.380
I tried it.

16:27.400 --> 16:28.740
One is out with one jab. It works.

16:28.760 --> 16:29.780
Who did you test it on?

16:29.800 --> 16:30.539
Physician Li.

16:30.559 --> 16:32.319
Ridiculous!
How could you stab Physician Li?

16:32.319 --> 16:33.179
He volunteered.

16:33.199 --> 16:34.679
Why would he volunteer himself
for the stab?

16:34.680 --> 16:36.179
He wanted to learn your surgical skills

16:36.199 --> 16:38.020
and said the chloroform
could be useful in the future.

16:38.030 --> 16:39.960
He wanted to figure out
the dosage himself.

16:40.240 --> 16:43.059
Ruoruo, you should learn from him.

16:43.079 --> 16:44.500
Medicine is for saving lives.

16:44.520 --> 16:46.179
I learned it to save lives too, Xian.

16:46.199 --> 16:47.539
I want to save you.

16:47.559 --> 16:48.939
Guards will protect me.

16:48.959 --> 16:51.339
But they didn't come in
when Wan'er was here.

16:51.359 --> 16:53.280
The guards are protecting me
from assassins.

16:53.280 --> 16:55.640
But the real danger
may not be an assassin.

16:59.719 --> 17:01.400
Come on, you two. Please stop.

17:03.640 --> 17:05.460
One wants to kill Mr. Wuzhu,

17:05.480 --> 17:07.560
and one wants to guard here
with a dagger.

17:10.599 --> 17:11.720
Xian.

17:15.080 --> 17:15.980
What are you doing?

17:16.000 --> 17:17.339
Xian, you are very emotional.

17:17.359 --> 17:18.899
Your stitches might tear.

17:18.919 --> 17:20.119
I'm good.

17:21.639 --> 17:23.099
Even though you say so,

17:23.119 --> 17:24.839
you are more nervous than me.

17:34.000 --> 17:35.520
Here, drink this.

17:39.639 --> 17:41.339
I just added a little.

17:41.359 --> 17:43.320
It will only put you to sleep.

17:43.480 --> 17:46.460
Xian, you need to rest now.

17:46.480 --> 17:48.240
Don't always think of protecting me.

17:51.319 --> 17:52.560
All right.

18:11.960 --> 18:13.440
If you see Mr. Wuzhu...

18:13.440 --> 18:14.539
I know.

18:14.559 --> 18:16.159
Don't let him hurt Wan'er.

18:18.319 --> 18:19.480
Ruoruo,

18:20.720 --> 18:22.159
this matter

18:23.639 --> 18:25.399
is far from over.

18:26.240 --> 18:27.370
It will be all right, Xian.

18:27.390 --> 18:28.800
Stop thinking about it.

18:28.839 --> 18:29.919
Sleep.

18:30.720 --> 18:32.439
With Mr. Wuzhu's skill,

18:33.079 --> 18:34.800
you don't have to worry too much.

18:35.240 --> 18:36.800
I hope so.

18:39.240 --> 18:41.280
With Mr. Wuzhu around...

19:00.079 --> 19:01.960
When Mr. Wuzhu is gone,

19:02.800 --> 19:04.800
I'm your last line of defense.

19:05.359 --> 19:06.520
Don't worry.

19:07.159 --> 19:08.859
No matter what happens,

19:08.879 --> 19:10.839
I will be there for you.

19:12.079 --> 19:13.560
I always will.

19:31.200 --> 19:32.800
I won't change

19:32.800 --> 19:34.560
your position as the empress.

19:35.399 --> 19:38.720
You don't need to meet Fan Xian.

19:39.280 --> 19:41.359
I just want to redeem myself.

19:53.119 --> 19:55.359
Just live your life well.

20:06.879 --> 20:08.980
What about the assassination
at Guangxin Palace?

20:09.000 --> 20:12.819
It has nothing to do with Li Yunrui.

20:12.839 --> 20:16.079
Who else could it be in the palace
besides Li Yunrui?

20:24.879 --> 20:25.959
You

20:27.040 --> 20:30.960
have worn out all my patience.

20:33.720 --> 20:34.879
After today,

20:36.559 --> 20:37.839
we won't meet again!

21:00.200 --> 21:01.280
Your Majesty.

21:04.200 --> 21:05.839
I was told

21:06.599 --> 21:08.560
that one who possesses everything

21:09.520 --> 21:11.359
will eventually lose all of them.

21:44.040 --> 21:45.159
Leave the Capital?

21:45.240 --> 21:47.399
It's His Majesty's order.

21:48.119 --> 21:50.200
Where am I going, then?

21:50.559 --> 21:52.020
His Majesty said

21:52.040 --> 21:53.140
you missed the flower festival

21:53.159 --> 21:56.139
because of the assassination back then.

21:56.159 --> 21:57.260
You can go back there

21:57.280 --> 21:59.119
and watch again.

22:00.159 --> 22:01.679
Can I not go there?

22:04.800 --> 22:06.359
He is unpredictable.

22:07.119 --> 22:09.339
Please give me a hand if you don't mind.

22:09.359 --> 22:11.139
Mr. Fan is getting into the carriage.

22:11.159 --> 22:12.439
Yes!

22:20.119 --> 22:21.839
He is on the way.

22:22.240 --> 22:23.700
Who?

22:23.720 --> 22:26.460
Mr. Fan is coming.

22:26.480 --> 22:27.839
Then who am I?

22:30.240 --> 22:31.679
Be careful.

22:33.760 --> 22:34.619
Gently.

22:34.639 --> 22:35.720
Stop there.

22:36.159 --> 22:37.299
Slowly.

22:37.319 --> 22:38.760
Slowly.

23:05.639 --> 23:07.960
Carry Mr. Fan into the carriage.

23:22.399 --> 23:23.500
Sir,

23:23.520 --> 23:24.600
please.

23:25.359 --> 23:26.639
Where?

23:36.440 --> 23:37.839
What does that mean?

23:38.240 --> 23:39.619
So, from now on, he is Fan Xian

23:39.639 --> 23:40.960
and I'm the dummy?

23:47.236 --> 23:49.040
If these two combine,

23:49.080 --> 23:50.520
the effect turns out mild.

23:50.879 --> 23:53.240
But this and this

23:53.680 --> 23:55.280
will produce an intense outcome.

23:55.520 --> 23:56.960
If the three of these

23:57.440 --> 23:58.879
combine,

24:00.520 --> 24:01.720
it's unsolvable.

24:04.839 --> 24:06.119
Here, make ways.

24:08.520 --> 24:09.760
You may leave.

24:11.800 --> 24:12.680
What's the matter?

24:12.700 --> 24:14.200
I came here to avoid trouble.

24:14.440 --> 24:16.240
Well, who is so frightening

24:16.359 --> 24:18.800
that makes you hide here?

24:18.919 --> 24:20.240
Fan Jian.

24:22.119 --> 24:24.359
This crabby old man.

24:25.350 --> 24:26.740
I better keep myself from him.

24:26.760 --> 24:27.740
Wait,

24:27.760 --> 24:29.520
why is he looking for you?

24:29.599 --> 24:31.040
Nothing serious.

24:31.159 --> 24:32.639
Fan Xian left the Capital.

24:33.200 --> 24:34.560
Fan Xian left...

24:34.839 --> 24:36.500
You said Fan Xian was injured.

24:36.520 --> 24:38.599
While Fan Xian was receiving treatment,

24:39.200 --> 24:40.119
an eunuch attacked him.

24:40.119 --> 24:40.940
But

24:40.960 --> 24:42.560
he is all right.

24:42.760 --> 24:45.879
Wait, how come the news
of the assassination leaked outside?

24:46.440 --> 24:48.059
That's why Fan Jian is anxious.

24:48.079 --> 24:50.859
This news wouldn't get out

24:50.879 --> 24:52.520
if His Majesty intended to hide.

24:58.480 --> 25:00.159
So this is a setup.

25:01.119 --> 25:02.760
Fan Xian is the bait.

25:02.800 --> 25:05.639
Who is expecting to take the bait?

25:07.079 --> 25:09.240
Fan Xian is injured.

25:09.720 --> 25:11.079
Mr. Wu

25:12.480 --> 25:14.159
hasn't shown up yet?

25:19.440 --> 25:23.800
People think
Fei Jie only knows poisoning skills.

25:24.720 --> 25:26.000
They are wrong.

26:11.960 --> 26:14.020
Resting for recovery in the palace,

26:14.040 --> 26:15.500
which is heavily guarded,

26:15.520 --> 26:17.439
it should be the safest place.

26:17.680 --> 26:19.539
Mr. Wu didn't show up,

26:19.559 --> 26:22.839
but he left the Capital alone
after the assassination.

26:25.000 --> 26:28.320
Mr. Wu must be protecting him secretly.

26:28.879 --> 26:30.599
So this setup

26:32.440 --> 26:34.159
is for Mr. Wu.

27:22.720 --> 27:25.200
There is something I can't figure out.

27:26.319 --> 27:28.359
Only grandmasters

27:28.760 --> 27:30.599
are capable

27:30.840 --> 27:32.481
to fight with Mr. Wu.

27:32.760 --> 27:35.500
Ye Liuyun is in Jiangnan,

27:35.520 --> 27:37.960
Ku He is in the north,

27:38.720 --> 27:39.559
and Sigu Jian...

27:39.559 --> 27:41.480
Sigu Jian is still in Dongyi City.

27:43.845 --> 27:46.766
Could it be the one in the palace?

27:48.040 --> 27:49.399
No.

27:50.359 --> 27:53.240
If it's really that person,

27:54.000 --> 27:57.399
the winner would be uncertain.

27:58.520 --> 27:59.879
If he is injured badly,

27:59.879 --> 28:02.240
the balance would be disrupted.

28:02.520 --> 28:06.280
His Majesty wouldn't take that risk.

28:07.599 --> 28:09.020
I was confined here

28:09.040 --> 28:13.200
because I was getting too close

28:13.200 --> 28:15.599
to the truth.

28:16.079 --> 28:18.639
The killer in Jiangnan

28:19.440 --> 28:21.480
isn't Mr. Wu.

28:22.839 --> 28:24.700
When that person ambushed me,

28:24.720 --> 28:27.520
the weapon he used
was similar to the one Mr. Wu used.

28:28.000 --> 28:30.280
Their skills were similar as well.

28:31.599 --> 28:33.819
He attacked members
of the Imperial Inspectorate

28:33.839 --> 28:36.000
to lure Mr. Wu out.

28:40.280 --> 28:41.899
His Majesty will cooperate with you

28:41.919 --> 28:44.030
to capture the betrayer
of the Divine Temple, sir.

28:59.079 --> 29:00.339
Someone from the Divine Temple

29:00.359 --> 29:01.520
was killing in Jiangnan

29:01.520 --> 29:03.399
in an attempt to find Mr. Wu.

29:04.240 --> 29:06.359
No wonder he was nowhere to be found

29:06.520 --> 29:08.639
after arriving in the Capital.

29:10.800 --> 29:13.800
Because His Majesty erased his traces.

29:15.839 --> 29:17.619
Well, this matter is over.

29:17.639 --> 29:20.480
Is His Majesty so desperate
to kill Mr. Wu?

29:21.319 --> 29:23.960
If he is, Hong Sixiang
should've stepped in.

29:25.319 --> 29:26.520
Wait.

29:27.399 --> 29:30.679
His Majesty and you
wouldn't make this kind of mistake.

29:31.680 --> 29:33.040
In this setup,

29:33.240 --> 29:36.200
His Majesty is expecting

29:36.240 --> 29:37.919
no winner.

29:40.800 --> 29:42.500
I know it,

29:42.520 --> 29:44.159
nothing can be hidden from you.

29:45.359 --> 29:46.439
Mr. Chen,

29:46.639 --> 29:49.520
why are you playing along
with this setup?

29:49.720 --> 29:53.059
Can you really bear to see Mr. Wu die?

29:53.079 --> 29:54.679
Over the past years,

29:54.800 --> 29:57.439
the Divine Temple
has been hunting Wuzhu down,

29:57.480 --> 29:59.180
not just today.

29:59.200 --> 30:02.040
You mean this isn't the first time?

30:02.480 --> 30:04.520
It's impossible both sides would lose.

30:05.200 --> 30:07.159
The ending is...

30:09.639 --> 30:11.200
Have faith in him.

30:13.240 --> 30:14.320
Mr. Chen,

30:15.359 --> 30:17.480
there is something I'm confused about.

30:18.440 --> 30:20.280
Which side are you on, honestly?

31:07.559 --> 31:09.240
I went to the south to look for you.

31:10.000 --> 31:11.480
You weren't there.

31:13.240 --> 31:15.079
You are the killer in Jiangnan.

31:15.480 --> 31:17.359
I expected you to show up.

31:18.390 --> 31:19.839
Why are you looking for me?

31:19.879 --> 31:21.240
Come back with me.

31:22.159 --> 31:23.560
You come from...

31:25.480 --> 31:26.760
The Divine Temple.

31:26.960 --> 31:28.359
You are the extra.

31:28.639 --> 31:30.320
You mustn't stay.

31:32.159 --> 31:33.560
Come back with me.

31:39.040 --> 31:40.120
I will.

31:42.079 --> 31:43.720
I have forgotten too much.

31:44.359 --> 31:45.879
Perhaps the Divine Temple

31:47.200 --> 31:49.200
can help me regain my lost past.

31:56.599 --> 31:59.439
Ye Qingmei should also go with us.

32:01.480 --> 32:03.000
She is dead.

32:03.639 --> 32:05.000
She had a son.

32:06.200 --> 32:07.980
That's a trace she left behind.

32:08.000 --> 32:09.879
A mistake that shouldn't have existed.

32:10.599 --> 32:13.200
Find him and bring him back to the Divine Temple.

32:15.520 --> 32:17.639
So you didn't know his identity.

32:17.839 --> 32:20.630
[Emissary of the Divine Temple]
Abrupt conclusion. Unclear premise.

32:20.639 --> 32:22.619
[Emissary of the Divine Temple]
Judging by the conversation,

32:22.639 --> 32:25.639
I seem to have met Ye Qingmei's son.

32:30.159 --> 32:31.399
Negotiations

32:32.280 --> 32:33.360
end.

33:35.200 --> 33:36.980
You chose to return
to the Divine Temple.

33:37.000 --> 33:39.059
This fight isn't reasonable.

33:39.079 --> 33:40.399
Protecting him

33:40.960 --> 33:42.599
is my mission.

36:00.319 --> 36:01.399
Your Majesty?

36:02.479 --> 36:03.640
What is this place?

36:07.560 --> 36:10.320
Somewhere you should've come long ago.

36:11.760 --> 36:13.160
There is a person

36:13.359 --> 36:15.399
you need to meet.

36:15.959 --> 36:17.039
Who?

36:17.800 --> 36:18.999
Come with me.

37:41.720 --> 37:44.479
You look as young as you used to be.

37:45.479 --> 37:48.399
But I have grown older.

38:01.160 --> 38:02.640
Take a good look.

38:03.479 --> 38:07.519
This is the only portrait
of your mother's.

38:26.039 --> 38:27.600
Back at the time,

38:27.879 --> 38:30.399
she was like a dazzling meteor

38:30.680 --> 38:34.640
and a fire burning brilliantly

38:34.839 --> 38:38.399
that amazed the Qing.

40:05.560 --> 40:06.640
Your Majesty,

40:06.800 --> 40:09.200
Wuzhu's strength is far above
the emissary's.

40:09.640 --> 40:11.899
We managed to pierce his armor
and shoot him with the new bow.

40:11.919 --> 40:13.439
But he still got away.

40:13.519 --> 40:15.800
Wuzhu was seriously injured
and disappeared.

40:15.999 --> 40:17.100
In my humble opinion,

40:17.120 --> 40:19.999
only grandmasters can defeat Wuzhu.

40:28.839 --> 40:31.080
The emissary of the Divine Temple

40:31.680 --> 40:33.919
is not a mortal.

40:36.439 --> 40:37.999
So what?

40:38.280 --> 40:39.999
He died anyway.

40:42.680 --> 40:43.760
Burn him.

40:44.080 --> 40:45.160
Yes.

41:17.519 --> 41:18.599
Come.

41:20.959 --> 41:21.999
Look at those chrysanthemums.

41:21.999 --> 41:25.160
Your mother planted them.

41:26.880 --> 41:29.880
Are those in the Hanging Temple
moved from here?

41:32.039 --> 41:32.970
Did you bring her with you

41:32.990 --> 41:34.819
every time you went
to the flower festival?

41:34.839 --> 41:36.439
She liked it.

41:36.680 --> 41:37.859
She liked flowers?

41:37.879 --> 41:41.399
She loved everything that had a life.

41:45.479 --> 41:47.919
Why does my mother look so young
in the portrait?

41:49.439 --> 41:53.879
This is what she looked like

41:54.120 --> 41:55.439
when I first met her.

42:00.120 --> 42:01.600
You miss her a lot.

42:02.999 --> 42:04.399
So

42:06.280 --> 42:09.060
I hand over
the Imperial Treasury to you

42:09.080 --> 42:12.600
because you are her son.

42:13.399 --> 42:15.080
Out of everyone in this world,

42:16.359 --> 42:17.999
it can only be you.

42:19.200 --> 42:20.439
Do I

42:21.560 --> 42:22.720
look like her?

42:23.959 --> 42:25.260
She was prettier.

42:25.280 --> 42:28.080
But you both have similar minds.

42:32.959 --> 42:34.720
I'm not as brave as her.

42:36.439 --> 42:39.319
I remember she once told me

42:39.319 --> 42:42.200
that being an emperor is challenging.

42:42.319 --> 42:46.299
One needs to be tough and resilient.

42:46.319 --> 42:47.479
Thus,

42:48.080 --> 42:49.680
there are things

42:49.839 --> 42:51.680
you need to abandon.

42:52.039 --> 42:53.320
Including those

42:54.560 --> 42:56.800
you hold dear to your heart.

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.160 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
